    {
      "id": "engine-choices-3",
      "title": "The petrol, diesel and turbo engines (cont.)",
      "role": "proof",
      "topic": "powertrain",
      "outcome": "Choose an engine and offered gearbox",
      "usp_ids": [
        "choose-your-gears"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "A turbo petrol choice means an automatic gearbox and the King trim; King also offers other engines, so specify turbo when comparing versions, before settling on the wheel style alongside it.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
            "ref": "im_pdf_87bac17ee980151549ba",
            "focus": "Turbo engine choice"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F003",
            "F005",
            "F006"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "engine-choices-L3",
          "start": 65.7,
          "duration": 16.3,
          "exact": false
        }
      ],
      "checkin": "",
      "deeper": [
        {
          "text": "The non-turbo petrol has a six-speed manual or IVT automatic. Manual trims are E, EX, EX(O), S(O), S(O) Knight, SX, SX Premium and King; automatic trims are EX(O), S(O), SX Premium, King, King Knight and Lounge Edition. These are the compiled nineteen September twenty twenty-six offerings, not a live stock check.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
            "ref": "im_pdf_98cd4a320f9dbfd33bbd",
            "focus": "Petrol gearbox matrix"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F003",
            "F009",
            "F065",
            "F066"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "engine-choices-D1"
        },
        {
          "text": "Diesel has a six-speed manual or six-speed automatic. Manual trims are E, EX, EX(O), S(O), S(O) Knight, SX Premium and King; automatic trims are EX(O), S(O), King, King Knight and Lounge Edition. Its stated torque is 250 Nm, or 25.5 kgm, at 1,500 to 2,750 r/min; this isn't a loaded-climb test.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
            "ref": "im_pdf_5cd207807990f4eea283",
            "focus": "Diesel gearbox matrix"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F003",
            "F007",
            "F008",
            "F067",
            "F068"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "engine-choices-D2"
        },
        {
          "text": "The 1.5-litre turbo petrol is listed only on King, with a seven-speed dual-clutch automatic. Its maximum power is 117.5 kW, or 160 PS, at 5,500 r/min; torque is 253 Nm, or 25.8 kgm, at 1,500 to 3,500 r/min. These are engine specifications, not acceleration measurements, and King also offers other engines.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
            "ref": "im_pdf_87bac17ee980151549ba",
            "focus": "Turbo engine specifications"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F003",
            "F004",
            "F005",
            "F006"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "engine-choices-D3"
        }
      ],
