    {
      "id": "shared-space",
      "title": "The rear seatbacks that fold",
      "role": "proof",
      "topic": "space-and-practicality",
      "outcome": "Arrange passenger space and luggage space",
      "usp_ids": [
        "space-for-changing-plans"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Packing alongside passengers, the standard split rear seat lets seating and luggage space share the cabin in different arrangements. The folded sections show that choice; occupants bring safety equipment into the decision.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
            "ref": "im_pdf_adb415f161dfc9567dde",
            "focus": "Folded rear seatbacks"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F022",
            "F023"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "shared-space-L1",
          "start": 96.7,
          "duration": 16.8,
          "exact": false
        }
      ],
      "checkin": "",
      "deeper": [
        {
          "text": "The rear seat has a sixty-forty split as standard across every trim. Hyundai describes the arrangement as balancing passenger comfort and storage capacity; the folded-seat picture shows the arrangement, not a boot-capacity measurement.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
            "ref": "im_pdf_adb415f161dfc9567dde",
            "focus": "Split seat arrangement"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F022",
            "F023"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "shared-space-D1"
        },
        {
          "text": "Rear passengers can adjust the seatback angle with two-step reclining from S(O), including S(O) Knight, SX, SX Premium, King, King Knight and Lounge Edition. No supplied picture demonstrates the reclining mechanism in operation.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "none",
            "ref": "",
            "focus": "Rear recline availability"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F021",
            "F024"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "shared-space-D2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Hyundai describes the boot as storage for luggage and travel essentials, but I can't confirm a capacity in litres from these details. An in-person check with the intended luggage can settle personal fit; the manufacturer must confirm the specification.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
            "ref": "im_pdf_086219c79f5c77a4f468",
            "focus": "Boot and luggage"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F063"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "shared-space-D3"
        }
      ],
      "stop_id": "space-and-practicality",
