          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "airbags-and-help-D1"
        },
        {
          "text": "Surround-view and blind-spot-view cameras start at SX Premium, including King, King Knight and Lounge Edition. The displayed camera views are different equipment from collision assistance; camera availability doesn't put adaptive cruise control on SX Premium.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
            "ref": "im_pdf_c8743c0adbf32f9b7e56",
            "focus": "Parking and side views"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F035",
            "F036"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "airbags-and-help-D2"
        },
        {
          "text": "King, King Knight and Lounge Edition have blind-spot warning and assistance plus lane-keeping assistance. Smart Cruise Control with Stop and Go is automatic-only on those trims; none of these systems replaces safe, attentive driving or guarantees intervention.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
